Usage: agent-deck tmux-hooks <command>

Manage the after-new-window hook agent-deck keeps on the tmux server
(slot after-new-window[2259]; it sizes windows opened by hand inside
agent-deck sessions and persists on the server after agent-deck exits).
Targets the server named by [tmux].socket_name, else the default one.

Commands:
  install      Install or refresh the hook (every session start does this too)
  uninstall    Remove the hook, only if the slot holds agent-deck's
  status       Show whether the slot is absent, agent-deck's, or foreign
  help         Show this help message
